OL,3,GNEWSA'I set up a performing arts school
OL,4,Ato future-proof my career'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the age of 11, Rosanna Harris was
OL,7,Fdetermined to follow her love of
OL,8,Ftheatre - and has since risen up the
OL,9,Franks on the big stage.
OL,11,FPlaying parts in Grease The Musical and
OL,12,FThe War of the Worlds, the now
OL,13,F34-year-old is starring in Legally
OL,14,FBlonde, which will be on stage at
OL,15,FAylesbury Waterside Theatre in
OL,16,FBuckinghamshire - close to where she
OL,17,Fperfected her skills at Tring Park
OL,18,FSchool for the Performing Arts.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
