OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I set up a performing arts school
OL,4,Ato future-proof my career'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a profession that is notoriously
OL,7,Fhard to break into and sustain, she
OL,8,Fsaid her decision to set up a
OL,9,Fperforming arts academy early in her
OL,10,Fcareer had taken away some of the
OL,11,Fstress of "how I'm going to pay my
OL,12,Fmortgage".
OL,14,FShe told the BBC it meant she could
OL,15,Fsuccessfully "do the two things that
OL,16,FI'm passionate about, which is
OL,17,Fperforming and also inspiring future
OL,18,Fperformers".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
